WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.617
This query uses ROW_NUMBER within each department.

00:00:03.617 --> 00:00:07.247
Salary descending defines the main order.

00:00:07.247 --> 00:00:12.227
Employee ID breaks exact salary ties deterministically.

00:00:12.227 --> 00:00:17.152
The outer query filters row number less than or equal to two.

00:00:17.152 --> 00:00:20.487
That returns at most two rows per department.

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:26.902
A CTE gives a name to an intermediate result so a complex query can be read in stages.

00:00:26.902 --> 00:00:34.442
Use it to clarify grain changes and major transformations, not simply to break every two lines into a new

00:00:34.442 --> 00:00:42.291
block. A useful CTE name describes what the rows represent, such as patient_totals or ranked_visits.
